<title>ITALY: Italy's Brindisi air cargo down 45.5pct in Jan 97.</title>
<headline>Italy's Brindisi air cargo down 45.5pct in Jan 97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo traffic handled at Italy's Brindisi airport totalled 14.3 tonnes in January 1997, down 45.5 percent against the same period 1996, the airport managing</p>
<p>company, SEAP said.</p>
<p> Imports		    8.3	down  57.9pct</p>
<p> Exports		    5.9	down   7.0</p>
<p> Total traffic	   14.3	down  45.5</p>
<p> Total mail		36.2	up   312.8</p>
<p> Total passengers    13,371	up    15.5</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
